'''Almácigo''' ({{IPA|an|alˈmaθiɡo}}) is the [[W:At-large|at-large]] [[Commune district|legislative district]] for the [[Almácigo|eponymous]] [[Cantons of Balisca|canton]]/city, within [[Llaragón]] (9) region. Like the other 735 Baliscan commune districts, it elects one [[Confederal Congress|delegate]] using the [[W:Instant-runoff voting|instant-runoff voting]] system.

